---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Founding reservation: what happens next"
  description="What happens after you reserve a founding spot."
  path="/founding/thanks"
  noindex={true}
>
  <article class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="kicker">FOUNDING MEMBERS</p>
      <h1>What happens after you reserve</h1>

      <p>
        Once Stripe confirms your $1, you're on the list and Stripe emails you a receipt. No receipt
        within a few minutes? Email <a href="mailto:support@buoy-ai.com">support@buoy-ai.com</a> and I'll check.
      </p>

      <h2>What happens next</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>You'll be among the first invited to the beta, by email.</li>
        <li>Your $1 comes off your first year when you start a plan.</li>
        <li>
          Your founding prices are locked, apart from any increase in what Plaid charges per
          connected bank, which is passed through at cost.
        </li>
        <li>
          I saved your card so starting a plan is one tap. It won't be charged again unless you
          choose a plan.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="fine">
        Changed your mind? Email <a href="mailto:support@buoy-ai.com">support@buoy-ai.com</a> and I refund the $1, no questions.
      </p>

      <p><a href="/" class="btn btn-ghost">Back to the home page</a></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .container.narrow {
    max-width: 640px;
    padding-top: clamp(48px, 8vw, 96px);
  }
  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  li + li {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .fine {
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
</style>
